Package: pkgledger
Type: Package
Title: Record and Manage R Package Versions and Citations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shimpei", "Morimoto", email = "mrmt.shmp@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools supporting package version management for reproducible
    analyses. The first function writes the R version and the versions and
    citations (text, BibTeX, LaTeX, HTML, R code, and author-supplied text
    versions) of loaded or attached packages to a plain-text report.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
